                                "sense_id": "a073b8f7-d570-3b72-ad89-c473166ad872",
                                "text": "In the latter case, known as GamerGate, video game developer Zoe Quinn and feminist media critic Anita Sarkeesian experienced an onslaught of virtual attacks and were forced to go into hiding after their addresses, phone numbers, and other personal details were revealed—or doxed—by online hackers."
